    {
      "id": "a59c3b4c-5dda-5c53-99bb-73d16ecf1905",
      "name": "About",
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Every outbound request goes through here\nInput: one item per request, `{service: xero|stripe, method, url, body?}`, or a single `{skip: true}` when the\ncaller has nothing to send (the chain keeps going). Output: the response bodies, in request order.\n\n**Xero:** OAuth2 client credentials (n8n refreshes the token), `Idempotency-Key` = sha256 of the request.\nA 429 fails the call with `XERO_RATE_LIMITED retry_after=N`: the processor pauses all Xero work for N seconds\nwithout counting an attempt. Under 5 calls left in the minute pauses the next batch for 60 s before Xero says no.\n**Stripe:** pinned API version, 10 requests a second.\nAny other 4xx/5xx fails the call; the processor retries the batch with backoff.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 640
      },
